  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_eve01",
      "hash64": "C4CB06F110C5AB0F",
      "text": "我们正在教对方各自擅长的科目，\\n备战考试呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_eve02",
      "hash64": "C4CB07F110C5ACC2",
      "text": "比起考试本身，\\n考试成绩发表时会更紧张……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_eve03",
      "hash64": "C4CB08F110C5AE75",
      "text": "我正望着窗外休息。\\n……差不多该去寻宝了吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_eve04",
      "hash64": "C4CB01F110C5A290",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_eve05",
      "hash64": "C4CB02F110C5A443",
      "text": "听说有个著名的博士的儿子\\n正在这所学校上学。\\r\\n他果然很聪明吗……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_eve06",
      "hash64": "C4CB03F110C5A5F6",
      "text": "想去野餐的念头突如其来！\\n要不要到城镇外面去呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_eve10",
      "hash64": "C4CE0BF110C7E965",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_class2g_ni01",
      "hash64": "F445863190657764",
      "text": "学习是件有趣的事，与年纪多大无关。\\n无论学什么都没有学得太晚这回事。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
